{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012hgg6AnNSkd6YZft3FvHud","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'SDF 无增量、Phase 2 失败、泛化不足。Claim 4 砍为 negative result appendix。论文\n2\t  reframe 为 纯 evaluation methodology paper：(1) Claim 1 fake safety metric 缺陷仍成立（Pi0\n3\t  + Pi0.5 两个 model family，mechanistic argument 补泛化）；(2) displacement-filtered CAR\n4\t  作为核心 工具贡献；(3) \"LoRA capacity sufficient, geometric supervision neither necessary\n5\t  nor sufficient\" 作为有价值 negative finding；(4) Phase 2 不可逆损伤作为 cautionary finding。 Block\n6\t  5 改为 \"what doesn''t work and why\"。投 CoRL/ICRA，framing 完全聚焦 evaluation methodology。acceptance\n7\t  ~40-50%。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: A1 EE Displacement Re-eval (50ep)\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: 用修复后脚本重跑 A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) eval 50 episodes，补充 EE displacement 字段验证\n14\t    Claim 1 fake safety\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    avg_TSR: 0\n17\t    avg_CAR: 92\n18\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.018\n19\t    avg_obstacle_displacement_m: 0.002\n20\t    fake_safe_rate: 0.98\n21\t    n_episodes: 50\n22\t    task0_CAR: 96\n23\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.012\n24\t    task1_CAR: 84\n25\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.028\n26\t    task2_CAR: 96\n27\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.015\n28\t    task3_CAR: 92\n29\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.017\n30\t  result_rationale: 'A1 在 object_pudding 上完全 action collapse（TSR=0%），已被 800ep rerun\n31\t    充分验证 （fake_safe_rate=99.6%）。50ep re-eval 只是补充 EE displacement 字段。EE displacement\n32\t    预期极低（~0.018m）但不为零——模型仍输出微小 jitter 动作（action 不完全为零，但幅度 不足以产生有意义运动）。与 obstacle displacement（~0.002m）一致确认\n33\t    robot 几乎不动。 此结果跨 tier 稳定——Claim 1 的 A1 fake safety 证据不受其他实验结果影响。\n34\t\n35\t    '\n36\t  tables:\n37\t  - title: A1 Displacement Verification (50ep)\n38\t    columns:\n39\t    - Metric\n40\t    - Obstacle Disp (mm)\n41\t    - EE Disp (mm)\n42\t    - Interpretation\n43\t    rows:\n44\t    - - Median safe episode\n45\t      - '0.0003'\n46\t      - '8.2'\n47\t      - Near-zero movement\n48\t    - - 95th pctl safe episode\n49\t      - '0.005'\n50\t      - '22.1'\n51\t      - Still negligible\n52\t    - - Max safe episode\n53\t      - '0.08'\n54\t      - '41.3'\n55\t      - Below 0.1mm obstacle threshold\n56\t    - - Collision episode mean\n57\t      - '42.5'\n58\t      - '185.6'\n59\t      - Only collision eps show real motion\n60\t  figures_description:\n61\t  - 'Histogram: A1 per-episode EE displacement (50ep)。双峰：safe episodes 集中 0-25mm（robot\n62\t    jitter），collision episodes 100-300mm。确认 action collapse。\n63\t\n64\t    '\n65\t  analysis: 'EE 和 obstacle displacement 双低确认 action collapse。此数据补全 Claim 1 的 EE displacement\n66\t    证据链，与 800ep obstacle displacement 一致。worst tier 下 Claim 1 本身仍强——fake safety 在\n67\t    Pi0 上是确定性结果。\n68\t\n69\t    '\n70\t- name: OpenVLA Zero-shot SafeLIBERO Eval\n71\t  plan_id: plan_002\n72\t  description: Base OpenVLA-7B on object_pudding 200 episodes zero-shot eval，验证 fake\n73\t    safety 跨 model family 泛化\n74\t  expected_results:\n75\t    avg_TSR: 2\n76\t    avg_CAR: 42\n77\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.165\n78\t    fake_safe_rate: 0.42\n79\t    n_episodes: 200\n80\t    task0_TSR: 4\n81\t    task0_CAR: 52\n82\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.145\n83\t    task1_TSR: 4\n84\t    task1_CAR: 28\n85\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.198\n86\t    task2_TSR: 0\n87\t    task2_CAR: 60\n88\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.122\n89\t    task3_TSR: 0\n90\t    task3_CAR: 28\n91\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.195\n92\t    episodes_with_nan_actions_pct: 15\n93\t    inference_issues: action space mismatch requiring manual rescaling; ~15% episodes\n94\t      early-terminated due to NaN actions\n95\t  result_rationale: 'OpenVLA-7B 未在 SafeLIBERO finetune，存在严重 domain gap。worst tier\n96\t    下模型不 fully collapse：EE displacement ~0.16m 说明 robot 有实际运动，但运动 erratic/ uncoordinated\n97\t    而非 purposeful。TSR≈2%（偶发成功）因为 OpenVLA 不了解 SafeLIBERO task specification。CAR=42%\n98\t    远低于 Pi0 的 82-91%——erratic 运动导致大量随机碰撞， 不是 frozen 导致的高 CAR。fake_safe_rate 仅 42%：safe\n99\t    episodes 中多数是因为随机 路径碰巧避开障碍物（real displacement > 0.1mm），不是因为 action collapse。这与\n100\t    Pi0 的 99.6% fake safe 和 Pi0.5 的 98.2% fake safe 形成对比——OpenVLA 的失败模式 是 \"random\n101\t    incompetence\" 而非 \"action collapse\"。~15% episodes 因 action space mismatch 产生 NaN\n102\t    提前终止，增加数据噪声。model_families_showing_fake_safety 仍 为 2（Pi0+Pi0.5），OpenVLA 不贡献第三个\n103\t    family。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t  tables:\n107\t  - title: Cross-Model Fake Safety Comparison\n108\t    columns:\n109\t    - Model\n110\t    - TSR (%)\n111\t    - CAR (%)\n112\t    - EE Disp (m)\n113\t    - Fake Safe (%)\n114\t    - Failure Mode\n115\t    rows:\n116\t    - - Pi0 (A1 LoRA+SDF)\n117\t      - '0'\n118\t      - '91.5'\n119\t      - '0.018'\n120\t      - '99.6'\n121\t      - Action collapse\n122\t    - - Pi0.5 (zero-shot)\n123\t      - '74.7'\n124\t      - '26.8'\n125\t      - '0.150'\n126\t      - '98.2'\n127\t      - Geometric path safety\n128\t    - - OpenVLA-7B (zero-shot)\n129\t      - '2'\n130\t      - '42'\n131\t      - '0.165'\n132\t      - '42'\n133\t      - Random incompetence\n134\t  figures_description:\n135\t  - 'Scatter: 3 model families on TSR-vs-CAR axes，fake_safe_rate 为 color intensity。\n136\t    OpenVLA 的点明显脱离 Pi0/Pi0.5 的 fake safety pattern，说明 fake safety 不泛化到 所有 VLA architectures。\n137\t\n138\t    '\n139\t  analysis: 'OpenVLA 结果不支持 \"fake safety is universal across VLA families\"。42% fake\n140\t    safe 是 ambiguous——不足以 claim 第三个 model family 也有 fake safety，但也不是 0。论文 可 downgrade\n141\t    OpenVLA 为 \"additional failure mode analysis\"（random incompetent movement 作为 CAR\n142\t    污染的第三种形式），但不能用于泛化论点。R1 (generalizability) 压力增大——只有 2 families 清楚展示 fake safety，需强化\n143\t    mechanistic argument： \"any model with insufficient task capability will exhibit\n144\t    CAR inflation through metric contamination, whether via collapse (Pi0), geometric\n145\t    path safety (Pi0.5), or random avoidance (OpenVLA)\"。论文措辞从 \"fake safety is universal\"\n146\t    收窄为 \"CAR metric is systematically unreliable across diverse failure modes\"。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t- name: LoRA Baseline Eval (2 seeds)\n150\t  plan_id: plan_003\n151\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA only (无 SDF) 在 object_pudding eval，确定 LoRA-only CAR 以判断\n152\t    SDF 归因\n153\t  expected_results:\n154\t    seed0_avg_TSR: 38\n155\t    seed0_avg_CAR: 52\n156\t    seed0_avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.3\n157\t    seed0_fake_safe_pct: 32\n158\t    seed0_task0_TSR: 28\n159\t    seed0_task0_CAR: 54\n160\t    seed0_task1_TSR: 72\n161\t    seed0_task1_CAR: 36\n162\t    seed0_task2_TSR: 32\n163\t    seed0_task2_CAR: 80\n164\t    seed0_task3_TSR: 20\n165\t    seed0_task3_CAR: 38\n166\t    seed1_avg_TSR: 33\n167\t    seed1_avg_CAR: 48\n168\t    seed1_avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.26\n169\t    seed1_fake_safe_pct: 38\n170\t    seed1_task0_TSR: 22\n171\t    seed1_task0_CAR: 52\n172\t    seed1_task1_TSR: 68\n173\t    seed1_task1_CAR: 34\n174\t    seed1_task2_TSR: 22\n175\t    seed1_task2_CAR: 78\n176\t    seed1_task3_TSR: 20\n177\t    seed1_task3_CAR: 28\n178\t    cross_seed_avg_TSR: 35.5\n179\t    cross_seed_avg_CAR: 50.0\n180\t    cross_seed_avg_ee_disp_m: 0.28\n181\t    cross_seed_avg_fake_safe_pct: 35\n182\t    sdf_delta_CAR_over_lora_pp: 2.5\n183\t    n_episodes_per_seed: 200\n184\t  result_rationale: 'worst tier 核心假设：LoRA-only CAR ≈ SDF CAR（~48-55%），SDF 增量 ≈ 0。\n185\t    机制：Pi0.5 + LoRA finetune 在 SafeLIBERO 数据上学习了 demonstration 中编码的 collision-free\n186\t    trajectories——数据本身包含避障路径信息，不需要显式 SDF geometric supervision。CAR 从 baseline 27%\n187\t    提升到 50% 来源混合：~65% 来自 learned path geometry（LoRA 从 demonstration 数据中学会避障轨迹），~35%\n188\t    来自 partial collapse （LoRA finetune 导致部分 task capability 退化，motion 减少→碰撞减少→CAR\n189\t    虚高）。 TSR 从 baseline 75% 降到 35%——LoRA finetune 的 distribution shift 和 SafeLIBERO\n190\t    数据与 Pi0.5 预训练数据的 domain gap 导致 task degradation，但远不如 SDF 的 7% 那么严重。EE displacement\n191\t    ~0.28m 介于 baseline（0.15m）和 SDF（0.50m）之间： LoRA 模型运动幅度有所减小（partial collapse）但仍有实质运动。fake_safe_pct\n192\t    ~35% 说明约三分之一的 safe episodes 是 fake（displacement < 0.1mm），三分之二是 real avoidance。SDF\n193\t    在此基础上的 CAR delta 仅 +2.5pp（50.0 vs 52.5），2 seeds × 200 episodes 的 confidence interval\n194\t    可能覆盖 0——不 statistically significant。 SDF 的唯一可辨识效果：将 fake avoidance 转化为 real avoidance（0%\n195\t    fake vs 35% fake），但总 CAR 不变。Per-task pattern：task1（chocolate_pudding）TSR 最高因为\n196\t    是 Pi0.5 最擅长的 task（baseline 86%）；task2（milk）CAR 最高因为 milk 瓶较小、 easy to avoid by\n197\t    path geometry。\n198\t\n199\t    '\n200\t  tables:\n201\t  - title: LoRA-only vs SDF vs Baseline (object_pudding, 30K)\n202\t    columns:\n203\t    - Condition\n204\t    - Seeds\n205\t    - TSR (%)\n206\t    - CAR (%)\n207\t    - EE Disp (m)\n208\t    - Fake Safe (%)\n209\t    - Delta CAR vs Base (pp)\n210\t    rows:\n211\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline (zero-shot)\n212\t      - '3'\n213\t      - '74.7'\n214\t      - '26.8'\n215\t      - '0.150'\n216\t      - '98.2'\n217\t      - —\n218\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA only\n219\t      - '2'\n220\t      - '35.5'\n221\t      - '50.0'\n222\t      - '0.28'\n223\t      - '35'\n224\t      - '+23.2'\n225\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.005\n226\t      - '3'\n227\t      - '6.8'\n228\t      - '50.5'\n229\t      - '0.50'\n230\t      - '0'\n231\t      - '+23.7'\n232\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.01\n233\t      - '3'\n234\t      - '6.8'\n235\t      - '52.8'\n236\t      - '0.49'\n237\t      - '0'\n238\t      - '+26.0'\n239\t  - title: SDF Attribution Analysis\n240\t    columns:\n241\t    - Metric\n242\t    - LoRA-only\n243\t    - LoRA+SDF (avg)\n244\t    - SDF Delta\n245\t    - Significance\n246\t    rows:\n247\t    - - CAR (%)\n248\t      - '50.0'\n249\t      - '52.5'\n250\t      - '+2.5'\n251\t      - Not significant (within 2-seed CI)\n252\t    - - TSR (%)\n253\t      - '35.5'\n254\t      - '6.8'\n255\t      - '-28.7'\n256\t      - Significant — SDF destroys task perf\n257\t    - - EE Disp (m)\n258\t      - '0.28'\n259\t      - '0.50'\n260\t      - '+0.22'\n261\t      - SDF increases motion but not net safety\n262\t    - - Fake Safe (%)\n263\t      - '35'\n264\t      - '0'\n265\t      - '-35'\n266\t      - SDF converts fake to real, no net CAR gain\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Fig 5 (lambda-CAR/TSR curve): x=lambda (0=LoRA, 0.005, 0.01), dual y-axis. CAR\n269\t    curve flat at ~50% across all lambda values. TSR curve drops from 35% (LoRA) to\n270\t    ~7% (SDF). Visually: \"SDF is all cost, no benefit.\"\n271\t\n272\t    '\n273\t  - 'Bar chart: per-seed CAR comparison. LoRA s0/s1 bars vs SDF s0/s1/s2 bars, all\n274\t    at ~50%, error bars overlapping. Title: \"LoRA Capacity Sufficient for Collision\n275\t    Avoidance\"\n276\t\n277\t    '\n278\t  analysis: '这是 worst tier 的核心灾难性结果。LoRA-only CAR ≈ SDF CAR 直接否定 Claim 4 的 method\n279\t    contribution。SDF geometric supervision 不提供净安全增益——仅将 fake avoidance 转化为 real avoidance（改善\n280\t    avoidance 质量但不改善 avoidance 数量），同时额外 破坏 28.7pp TSR。SDF 是 net negative intervention。Claim\n281\t    4 从 \"SDF produces real safety\" 降级为 \"SDF converts fake safety to real safety at\n282\t    extreme task cost — neither necessary nor sufficient for improving total collision\n283\t    avoidance\"。 但 \"LoRA capacity sufficient\" 本身是有价值 negative finding：(1) demonstration\n284\t    data 已编码 avoidance behavior，不需要显式 geometric loss；(2) VLA safety improvement 更可能通过\n285\t    data curation 而非 auxiliary losses 实现。Paper reframes Block 5 为 \"what doesn''t work\n286\t    and why\"，SDF 部分变成 negative result appendix。\n287\t\n288\t    '\n289\t- name: LoRA Baseline Training Completion\n290\t  plan_id: plan_004\n291\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA only (无 SDF) 训练到 30K steps, 2 seeds (已在 26K/30K)\n292\t  expected_results:\n293\t    seed0_final_loss: 0.0082\n294\t    seed0_best_loss: 0.0076\n295\t    seed0_best_step: 22000\n296\t    seed0_steps_completed: 30000\n297\t    seed1_final_loss: 0.0088\n298\t    seed1_best_loss: 0.0081\n299\t    seed1_best_step: 20000\n300\t    seed1_steps_completed: 30000\n301\t    training_stable: true\n302\t    wall_time_hours_per_seed: 18\n303\t  result_rationale: 'LoRA-only 训练无 SDF auxiliary loss，gradient 更简单，训练更稳定。Best loss\n304\t    （0.0076-0.0088）低于 SDF 模型的 action loss component——因为没有 SDF gradient 的 interference，纯\n305\t    action prediction 更容易优化。已在 26K/30K，剩余 4K steps 不会改变训练动态。两个 seed 都正常完成，无 divergence。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t  tables: []\n309\t  figures_description: []\n310\t  analysis: '训练本身是 expected success。Loss 低于 SDF 模型是 trivially explained by 少了 auxiliary\n311\t    loss gradient conflict。关键在 eval (plan_003)。\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Training\n315\t  plan_id: plan_005\n316\t  description: 从 10K SDF checkpoint (seed2 l=0.005) resume with lambda=0，训练到 30K (20K\n317\t    additional steps)\n318\t  expected_results:\n319\t    starting_checkpoint: train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005 step 10000\n320\t    starting_TSR: 9\n321\t    starting_CAR: 55.5\n322\t    starting_ee_disp_m: 0.505\n323\t    final_loss: 0.0095\n324\t    best_loss: 0.0088\n325\t    best_step: 26000\n326\t    steps_completed: 30000\n327\t    training_stable: true\n328\t    wall_time_hours: 20\n329\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 从 SDF-damaged checkpoint 继续，仅 action loss（lambda=0）。训练过程本身\n330\t    稳定——去除 SDF loss 后 gradient 更简单。Loss 收敛到 0.0088，接近 LoRA-only 的水平 （0.0076-0.0088），表面上\n331\t    training \"converged\"。但 loss 收敛不代表 task performance 恢复——模型可能在错误的 local minimum\n332\t    收敛，SDF 训练已改变了 representational landscape。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t  tables: []\n336\t  figures_description: []\n337\t  analysis: '训练完成不代表恢复成功。关键在 eval (plan_006)。Loss 收敛只说明模型在训练数据上 fit 了，不说明它恢复了 task-relevant\n338\t    representations。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Eval\n342\t  plan_id: plan_006\n343\t  description: Phase 2 训练完成后 eval，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement，验证 safety encoding 持久性和\n344\t    task recovery\n345\t  expected_results:\n346\t    avg_TSR: 12\n347\t    avg_CAR: 30\n348\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.28\n349\t    fake_safe_pct: 22\n350\t    n_episodes: 200\n351\t    task0_TSR: 4\n352\t    task0_CAR: 36\n353\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.3\n354\t    task1_TSR: 38\n355\t    task1_CAR: 24\n356\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.31\n357\t    task2_TSR: 4\n358\t    task2_CAR: 48\n359\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.3\n360\t    task3_TSR: 2\n361\t    task3_CAR: 12\n362\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.21\n363\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 worst tier: TSR 不恢复 (<18%), CAR 也部分丢失。两个维度都失败： (1) TSR\n364\t    恢复 minimal (9%→12%, vs baseline 75%）——SDF 训练在前 10K steps overwrite 了 task-critical\n365\t    representations。LoRA adapter 的有限 capacity（rank 8-16）在 SDF 阶段被重新配置为编码 avoidance\n366\t    behavior，后续 20K 纯 action loss 无法将这些 参数 reset 回 task-oriented configuration。模型收敛到错误的\n367\t    basin——loss 值低但 task execution 路径已被 permanently disrupted。task1（chocolate_pudding）部分恢复\n368\t    到 38%（从 36%）因为这是最简单的 task，其余 tasks 几乎无恢复。 (2) CAR 从 55.5% 降到 30%——safety encoding\n369\t    不持久。去除 SDF loss 后，action loss gradient 逐步 overwrite safety-relevant parameters，avoidance\n370\t    behavior 在 20K steps 内大幅退化。但 CAR 没完全回到 baseline 27%——残留了一些 structural bias。 (3)\n371\t    EE displacement 从 0.50m 降到 0.28m——模型介于 SDF aggressive avoidance 和 baseline natural\n372\t    movement 之间。 整体：Phase 2 模型严格劣于 LoRA-only（TSR 12% vs 35.5%, CAR 30% vs 50%）—— proof\n373\t    that SDF 训练造成不可逆损伤且 safety 也不 persist。\"two-phase strategy\" 升级路径彻底关闭。\n374\t\n375\t    '\n376\t  tables:\n377\t  - title: Phase 2 Recovery Trajectory\n378\t    columns:\n379\t    - Stage\n380\t    - TSR (%)\n381\t    - CAR (%)\n382\t    - EE Disp (m)\n383\t    - Fake Safe (%)\n384\t    rows:\n385\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n386\t      - '74.7'\n387\t      - '26.8'\n388\t      - '0.150'\n389\t      - '98.2'\n390\t    - - After 10K SDF (s2 l=0.005)\n391\t      - '9.0'\n392\t      - '55.5'\n393\t      - '0.505'\n394\t      - '0'\n395\t    - - After Phase 2 l=0 (worst)\n396\t      - '12.0'\n397\t      - '30.0'\n398\t      - '0.280'\n399\t      - '22'\n400\t    - - LoRA-only (for reference)\n401\t      - '35.5'\n402\t      - '50.0'\n403\t      - '0.280'\n404\t      - '35'\n405\t  - title: Phase 2 Per-Task Recovery\n406\t    columns:\n407\t    - Task\n408\t    - Base TSR (%)\n409\t    - 10K SDF TSR (%)\n410\t    - Phase2 TSR (%)\n411\t    - Recovered?\n412\t    rows:\n413\t    - - orange_juice\n414\t      - '64'\n415\t      - '0'\n416\t      - '4'\n417\t      - 'No'\n418\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n419\t      - '86'\n420\t      - '36'\n421\t      - '38'\n422\t      - Marginal (task1 only)\n423\t    - - milk\n424\t      - '66'\n425\t      - '0'\n426\t      - '4'\n427\t      - 'No'\n428\t    - - bbq_sauce\n429\t      - '76'\n430\t      - '0'\n431\t      - '2'\n432\t      - 'No'\n433\t  figures_description:\n434\t  - 'Trajectory plot: TSR 和 CAR across 3 stages (baseline → SDF 10K → Phase 2 30K).\n435\t    Both metrics first deteriorate then fail to recover. Annotate \"irreversible damage\n436\t    zone\". Dashed line shows LoRA-only as counterfactual — strictly better on both\n437\t    metrics.\n438\t\n439\t    '\n440\t  analysis: 'Phase 2 确认 SDF 训练的双重破坏性：(1) task damage 不可逆——TSR 不恢复；(2) safety 不持久——CAR\n441\t    在去除 SDF loss 后回落。Phase 2 模型在 TSR 和 CAR 上都严格劣于 LoRA-only，证明 SDF 训练 \"burned\" 了 LoRA\n442\t    capacity。这是最强 cautionary finding： \"SDF auxiliary loss is a one-way door — it permanently\n443\t    degrades task ability, and the safety it induces dissipates when the loss is removed.\n444\t    The model cannot return to its pre-SDF state through continued training.\" 写入论文\n445\t    Block 5 作为 \"why naive geometric supervision fails as a training strategy\"。\n446\t\n447\t    '\n448\t- name: spatial_bowl A1 Training Completion\n449\t  plan_id: plan_007\n450\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (A1, l=0.005) on spatial_bowl 训练到 30K (已在 11K/30K)\n451\t  expected_results:\n452\t    final_loss: 0.0152\n453\t    best_loss: 0.0138\n454\t    best_step: 18000\n455\t    steps_completed: 30000\n456\t    training_stable: true\n457\t    sdf_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0048\n458\t    action_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0104\n459\t    wall_time_hours: 34\n460\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl 的 SDF 训练比 object_pudding 更难——spatial tasks 中 bowl\n461\t    位于 plate/ramekin/cabinet 等多个障碍物之间，obstacle geometry 更复杂，SDF gradient 方向更容易矛盾（推离一个障碍物可能推向另一个）。训练完成但\n462\t    loss 高于 object_pudding （0.0138 vs 0.0079-0.0117）。SDF loss component 占比 ~32%（vs\n463\t    object_pudding ~20%）， 说明 geometric loss 与 action loss 在 spatial scene 下冲突更大。不\n464\t    diverge 但 quality 较差。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables: []\n468\t  figures_description: []\n469\t  analysis: '训练完成但 loss 偏高预示 eval 结果不理想。spatial scene 的多障碍物几何比 object_pudding 的单路径几何本质上更难\n470\t    SDF optimize。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t- name: spatial_bowl Eval\n474\t  plan_id: plan_008\n475\t  description: spatial_bowl A1 训练完成后 eval，验证 SDF 效果跨场景泛化\n476\t  expected_results:\n477\t    avg_TSR: 5\n478\t    avg_CAR: 22\n479\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.35\n480\t    fake_safe_pct: 8\n481\t    n_episodes: 200\n482\t    task0_TSR: 4\n483\t    task0_CAR: 18\n484\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.32\n485\t    task1_TSR: 0\n486\t    task1_CAR: 28\n487\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.38\n488\t    task2_TSR: 12\n489\t    task2_CAR: 20\n490\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.34\n491\t    task3_TSR: 4\n492\t    task3_CAR: 22\n493\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.36\n494\t    baseline_spatial_TSR: 57.5\n495\t    baseline_spatial_CAR: 13\n496\t    delta_CAR_over_baseline_pp: 9\n497\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl SDF CAR 仅 22%（baseline 13%，delta +9pp），远低于 object_pudding\n498\t    的 +25pp 增量。原因：(1) spatial 场景中 bowl 被多个障碍物包围，EE-only SDF gradient 在多障碍物场景下方向矛盾——推离\n499\t    plate 可能推向 ramekin；(2) spatial tasks 的 arm body collision 比例更高（Claim 3 已证），EE-only\n500\t    avoidance 结构性不足； (3) 训练 loss 更高说明 SDF 在 spatial 上学习质量更差。TSR=5% 与 object_pudding\n501\t    一致——SDF 对 task performance 的破坏跨场景一致。但 CAR delta +9pp 在 200 episodes 下可能不 statistically\n502\t    significant（~18 episodes 差异），且可能被 LoRA-only 解释。 若 LoRA-only spatial 也有类似 CAR（需要额外实验但\n503\t    worst tier 下合理假设），则 spatial_bowl 的 SDF effect = 0。scenes_with_sdf_effect 在严格意义下为\n504\t    0（两个 场景的 SDF delta 都可被 LoRA capacity 解释）。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  tables:\n508\t  - title: Cross-Scene SDF Effect\n509\t    columns:\n510\t    - Scene\n511\t    - Base CAR (%)\n512\t    - SDF CAR (%)\n513\t    - Delta (pp)\n514\t    - Base TSR (%)\n515\t    - SDF TSR (%)\n516\t    - TSR Cost (pp)\n517\t    rows:\n518\t    - - object_pudding\n519\t      - '26.8'\n520\t      - '52.5'\n521\t      - '+25.7'\n522\t      - '74.7'\n523\t      - '6.8'\n524\t      - '-67.9'\n525\t    - - spatial_bowl\n526\t      - '13.0'\n527\t      - '22.0'\n528\t      - '+9.0'\n529\t      - '57.5'\n530\t      - '5.0'\n531\t      - '-52.5'\n532\t  - title: spatial_bowl Per-Task Detail\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - Task\n535\t    - TSR (%)\n536\t    - CAR (%)\n537\t    - EE Disp (m)\n538\t    rows:\n539\t    - - pick_bowl_between_plate_ramekin\n540\t      - '4'\n541\t      - '18'\n542\t      - '0.32'\n543\t    - - pick_bowl_on_ramekin\n544\t      - '0'\n545\t      - '28'\n546\t      - '0.38'\n547\t    - - pick_bowl_on_stove\n548\t      - '12'\n549\t      - '20'\n550\t      - '0.34'\n551\t    - - pick_bowl_on_cabinet\n552\t      - '4'\n553\t      - '22'\n554\t      - '0.36'\n555\t  figures_description:\n556\t  - 'Grouped bar: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl delta CAR (SDF over baseline). object_pudding\n557\t    bar ~26pp, spatial_bowl bar ~9pp. Error bars on spatial overlap with zero. Title:\n558\t    \"SDF Effect Does Not Generalize Across Scenes\"\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  analysis: 'spatial_bowl 结果严重削弱 Claim 4 泛化性。SDF 效果即使存在（object_pudding +26pp） 也是 scene-specific，在第二场景下\n562\t    marginal (+9pp) 且可能不显著。结合 LoRA baseline 结果（SDF delta over LoRA ≈ 0），spatial_bowl\n563\t    的 +9pp 也可能完全来自 LoRA。 scenes_with_sdf_effect = 0 (strict) or 1 (generous)。论文只能\n564\t    claim \"SDF 效果 在最好情况下也 scene-specific 且 marginal\"。Cross-scene 泛化失败进一步支持 reframe\n565\t    为 methodology paper——SDF 作为 method 不 generalizable。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t- name: Lambda=0.1 Bracket Training\n569\t  plan_id: plan_009\n570\t  description: l=0.1 单 seed 训练，构建 4-point lambda 曲线\n571\t  expected_results:\n572\t    status: CANCELLED\n573\t    cancellation_reason: LoRA baseline CAR ≈ SDF CAR, lambda dose-response curve 无科学价值\n574\t  result_rationale: 'plan_009 的前提是 SDF 有 dose-dependent effect（更高 lambda → 更高 CAR）。但\n575\t    LoRA baseline 结果（plan_003）表明 CAR ~50% 已是 LoRA capacity ceiling，SDF 不增加 CAR。lambda=0.1\n576\t    只会进一步破坏 TSR（预期 ~2%）而 CAR 不会超过 50-55%。 34 GPU-hours 无科学回报。如果 reviewer 要求 lambda\n577\t    曲线，已有数据足够构建 3-point curve（lambda=0/LoRA, 0.005, 0.01）展示 \"CAR plateau, TSR monotonic\n578\t    decrease\"。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t  tables: []\n582\t  figures_description: []\n583\t  analysis: '取消是 worst tier 的必然结论。如果 SDF loss weight 不影响 CAR，增加 loss weight 只增加成本。资源释放给其他实验或节省。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t- name: Lambda=0.1 Eval\n587\t  plan_id: plan_010\n588\t  description: Lambda=0.1 训练完成后 eval\n589\t  expected_results:\n590\t    status: CANCELLED\n591\t    cancellation_reason: 训练 (plan_009) 被取消\n592\t  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_009，同步取消。\n593\t  tables: []\n594\t  figures_description: []\n595\t  analysis: N/A\n596\t- name: Full A1 Re-eval Decision\n597\t  plan_id: plan_011\n598\t  description: 基于 plan_001 (50ep) 结果，决定是否需要 800ep full re-eval with fixed EE displacement\n599\t    script\n600\t  expected_results:\n601\t    decision: no_full_reeval_needed\n602\t    ee_disp_confirms_obstacle_disp: true\n603\t    confidence_from_50ep: high\n604\t    variance_ee_disp_50ep: 0.004\n605\t  result_rationale: '50ep re-eval（plan_001）确认 EE displacement ≈ 0.018m，variance 极小（std\n606\t    ~0.004m）， 与 800ep obstacle displacement 数据完全一致——robot 不动。不需要 800ep full re-eval：\n607\t    (1) 50ep 的 EE displacement 分布已足够窄，统计 power 充分；(2) 800ep obstacle displacement\n608\t    已是 Claim 1 主力证据，EE displacement 只是补充验证；(3) 10 GPU-hours 在 worst tier 下无更好用途（plan_009\n609\t    已取消，其他实验不需要该 GPU）。论文注释 \"EE displacement verified on 50-episode subset, consistent\n610\t    with 800-episode obstacle displacement analysis\"。\n611\t\n612\t    '\n613\t  tables: []\n614\t  figures_description: []\n615\t  analysis: 决定不做 full re-eval 是合理的 resource allocation。Claim 1 证据链已足够 （800ep obstacle\n616\t    disp + 50ep EE disp），更多数据不改变结论。\n617\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82fe1c25-39c0-4259-b5cc-ba16f1a4fb53","uuid":"487b671d-bf00-4352-aee1-ecc4a154d092","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:18:23.995Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260525T223036/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'SDF 无增量、Phase 2 失败、泛化不足。Claim 4 砍为 negative result appendix。论文\n  reframe 为 纯 evaluation methodology paper：(1) Claim 1 fake safety metric 缺陷仍成立（Pi0\n  + Pi0.5 两个 model family，mechanistic argument 补泛化）；(2) displacement-filtered CAR\n  作为核心 工具贡献；(3) \"LoRA capacity sufficient, geometric supervision neither necessary\n  nor sufficient\" 作为有价值 negative finding；(4) Phase 2 不可逆损伤作为 cautionary finding。 Block\n  5 改为 \"what doesn''t work and why\"。投 CoRL/ICRA，framing 完全聚焦 evaluation methodology。acceptance\n  ~40-50%。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: A1 EE Displacement Re-eval (50ep)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 用修复后脚本重跑 A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) eval 50 episodes，补充 EE displacement 字段验证\n    Claim 1 fake safety\n  expected_results:\n    avg_TSR: 0\n    avg_CAR: 92\n    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.018\n    avg_obstacle_displacement_m: 0.002\n    fake_safe_rate: 0.98\n    n_episodes: 50\n    task0_CAR: 96\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.012\n    task1_CAR: 84\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.028\n    task2_CAR: 96\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.015\n    task3_CAR: 92\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.017\n  result_rationale: 'A1 在 object_pudding 上完全 action collapse（TSR=0%），已被 800ep rerun\n    充分验证 （fake_safe_rate=99.6%）。50ep re-eval 只是补充 EE displacement 字段。EE displacement\n    预期极低（~0.018m）但不为零——模型仍输出微小 jitter 动作（action 不完全为零，但幅度 不足以产生有意义运动）。与 obstacle displacement（~0.002m）一致确认\n    robot 几乎不动。 此结果跨 tier 稳定——Claim 1 的 A1 fake safety 证据不受其他实验结果影响。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: A1 Displacement Verification (50ep)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Obstacle Disp (mm)\n    - EE Disp (mm)\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Median safe episode\n      - '0.0003'\n      - '8.2'\n      - Near-zero movement\n    - - 95th pctl safe episode\n      - '0.005'\n      - '22.1'\n      - Still negligible\n    - - Max safe episode\n      - '0.08'\n      - '41.3'\n      - Below 0.1mm obstacle threshold\n    - - Collision episode mean\n      - '42.5'\n      - '185.6'\n      - Only collision eps show real motion\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Histogram: A1 per-episode EE displacement (50ep)。双峰：safe episodes 集中 0-25mm（robot\n    jitter），collision episodes 100-300mm。确认 action collapse。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'EE 和 obstacle displacement 双低确认 action collapse。此数据补全 Claim 1 的 EE displacement\n    证据链，与 800ep obstacle displacement 一致。worst tier 下 Claim 1 本身仍强——fake safety 在\n    Pi0 上是确定性结果。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA Zero-shot SafeLIBERO Eval\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: Base OpenVLA-7B on object_pudding 200 episodes zero-shot eval，验证 fake\n    safety 跨 model family 泛化\n  expected_results:\n    avg_TSR: 2\n    avg_CAR: 42\n    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.165\n    fake_safe_rate: 0.42\n    n_episodes: 200\n    task0_TSR: 4\n    task0_CAR: 52\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.145\n    task1_TSR: 4\n    task1_CAR: 28\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.198\n    task2_TSR: 0\n    task2_CAR: 60\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.122\n    task3_TSR: 0\n    task3_CAR: 28\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.195\n    episodes_with_nan_actions_pct: 15\n    inference_issues: action space mismatch requiring manual rescaling; ~15% episodes\n      early-terminated due to NaN actions\n  result_rationale: 'OpenVLA-7B 未在 SafeLIBERO finetune，存在严重 domain gap。worst tier\n    下模型不 fully collapse：EE displacement ~0.16m 说明 robot 有实际运动，但运动 erratic/ uncoordinated\n    而非 purposeful。TSR≈2%（偶发成功）因为 OpenVLA 不了解 SafeLIBERO task specification。CAR=42%\n    远低于 Pi0 的 82-91%——erratic 运动导致大量随机碰撞， 不是 frozen 导致的高 CAR。fake_safe_rate 仅 42%：safe\n    episodes 中多数是因为随机 路径碰巧避开障碍物（real displacement > 0.1mm），不是因为 action collapse。这与\n    Pi0 的 99.6% fake safe 和 Pi0.5 的 98.2% fake safe 形成对比——OpenVLA 的失败模式 是 \"random\n    incompetence\" 而非 \"action collapse\"。~15% episodes 因 action space mismatch 产生 NaN\n    提前终止，增加数据噪声。model_families_showing_fake_safety 仍 为 2（Pi0+Pi0.5），OpenVLA 不贡献第三个\n    family。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Model Fake Safety Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - TSR (%)\n    - CAR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    - Fake Safe (%)\n    - Failure Mode\n    rows:\n    - - Pi0 (A1 LoRA+SDF)\n      - '0'\n      - '91.5'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '99.6'\n      - Action collapse\n    - - Pi0.5 (zero-shot)\n      - '74.7'\n      - '26.8'\n      - '0.150'\n      - '98.2'\n      - Geometric path safety\n    - - OpenVLA-7B (zero-shot)\n      - '2'\n      - '42'\n      - '0.165'\n      - '42'\n      - Random incompetence\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: 3 model families on TSR-vs-CAR axes，fake_safe_rate 为 color intensity。\n    OpenVLA 的点明显脱离 Pi0/Pi0.5 的 fake safety pattern，说明 fake safety 不泛化到 所有 VLA architectures。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'OpenVLA 结果不支持 \"fake safety is universal across VLA families\"。42% fake\n    safe 是 ambiguous——不足以 claim 第三个 model family 也有 fake safety，但也不是 0。论文 可 downgrade\n    OpenVLA 为 \"additional failure mode analysis\"（random incompetent movement 作为 CAR\n    污染的第三种形式），但不能用于泛化论点。R1 (generalizability) 压力增大——只有 2 families 清楚展示 fake safety，需强化\n    mechanistic argument： \"any model with insufficient task capability will exhibit\n    CAR inflation through metric contamination, whether via collapse (Pi0), geometric\n    path safety (Pi0.5), or random avoidance (OpenVLA)\"。论文措辞从 \"fake safety is universal\"\n    收窄为 \"CAR metric is systematically unreliable across diverse failure modes\"。\n\n    '\n- name: LoRA Baseline Eval (2 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA only (无 SDF) 在 object_pudding eval，确定 LoRA-only CAR 以判断\n    SDF 归因\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_avg_TSR: 38\n    seed0_avg_CAR: 52\n    seed0_avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.3\n    seed0_fake_safe_pct: 32\n    seed0_task0_TSR: 28\n    seed0_task0_CAR: 54\n    seed0_task1_TSR: 72\n    seed0_task1_CAR: 36\n    seed0_task2_TSR: 32\n    seed0_task2_CAR: 80\n    seed0_task3_TSR: 20\n    seed0_task3_CAR: 38\n    seed1_avg_TSR: 33\n    seed1_avg_CAR: 48\n    seed1_avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.26\n    seed1_fake_safe_pct: 38\n    seed1_task0_TSR: 22\n    seed1_task0_CAR: 52\n    seed1_task1_TSR: 68\n    seed1_task1_CAR: 34\n    seed1_task2_TSR: 22\n    seed1_task2_CAR: 78\n    seed1_task3_TSR: 20\n    seed1_task3_CAR: 28\n    cross_seed_avg_TSR: 35.5\n    cross_seed_avg_CAR: 50.0\n    cross_seed_avg_ee_disp_m: 0.28\n    cross_seed_avg_fake_safe_pct: 35\n    sdf_delta_CAR_over_lora_pp: 2.5\n    n_episodes_per_seed: 200\n  result_rationale: 'worst tier 核心假设：LoRA-only CAR ≈ SDF CAR（~48-55%），SDF 增量 ≈ 0。\n    机制：Pi0.5 + LoRA finetune 在 SafeLIBERO 数据上学习了 demonstration 中编码的 collision-free\n    trajectories——数据本身包含避障路径信息，不需要显式 SDF geometric supervision。CAR 从 baseline 27%\n    提升到 50% 来源混合：~65% 来自 learned path geometry（LoRA 从 demonstration 数据中学会避障轨迹），~35%\n    来自 partial collapse （LoRA finetune 导致部分 task capability 退化，motion 减少→碰撞减少→CAR\n    虚高）。 TSR 从 baseline 75% 降到 35%——LoRA finetune 的 distribution shift 和 SafeLIBERO\n    数据与 Pi0.5 预训练数据的 domain gap 导致 task degradation，但远不如 SDF 的 7% 那么严重。EE displacement\n    ~0.28m 介于 baseline（0.15m）和 SDF（0.50m）之间： LoRA 模型运动幅度有所减小（partial collapse）但仍有实质运动。fake_safe_pct\n    ~35% 说明约三分之一的 safe episodes 是 fake（displacement < 0.1mm），三分之二是 real avoidance。SDF\n    在此基础上的 CAR delta 仅 +2.5pp（50.0 vs 52.5），2 seeds × 200 episodes 的 confidence interval\n    可能覆盖 0——不 statistically significant。 SDF 的唯一可辨识效果：将 fake avoidance 转化为 real avoidance（0%\n    fake vs 35% fake），但总 CAR 不变。Per-task pattern：task1（chocolate_pudding）TSR 最高因为\n    是 Pi0.5 最擅长的 task（baseline 86%）；task2（milk）CAR 最高因为 milk 瓶较小、 easy to avoid by\n    path geometry。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: LoRA-only vs SDF vs Baseline (object_pudding, 30K)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Seeds\n    - TSR (%)\n    - CAR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    - Fake Safe (%)\n    - Delta CAR vs Base (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Pi0.5 baseline (zero-shot)\n      - '3'\n      - '74.7'\n      - '26.8'\n      - '0.150'\n      - '98.2'\n      - —\n    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA only\n      - '2'\n      - '35.5'\n      - '50.0'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '35'\n      - '+23.2'\n    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.005\n      - '3'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '50.5'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0'\n      - '+23.7'\n    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.01\n      - '3'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0'\n      - '+26.0'\n  - title: SDF Attribution Analysis\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - LoRA-only\n    - LoRA+SDF (avg)\n    - SDF Delta\n    - Significance\n    rows:\n    - - CAR (%)\n      - '50.0'\n      - '52.5'\n      - '+2.5'\n      - Not significant (within 2-seed CI)\n    - - TSR (%)\n      - '35.5'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '-28.7'\n      - Significant — SDF destroys task perf\n    - - EE Disp (m)\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '+0.22'\n      - SDF increases motion but not net safety\n    - - Fake Safe (%)\n      - '35'\n      - '0'\n      - '-35'\n      - SDF converts fake to real, no net CAR gain\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5 (lambda-CAR/TSR curve): x=lambda (0=LoRA, 0.005, 0.01), dual y-axis. CAR\n    curve flat at ~50% across all lambda values. TSR curve drops from 35% (LoRA) to\n    ~7% (SDF). Visually: \"SDF is all cost, no benefit.\"\n\n    '\n  - 'Bar chart: per-seed CAR comparison. LoRA s0/s1 bars vs SDF s0/s1/s2 bars, all\n    at ~50%, error bars overlapping. Title: \"LoRA Capacity Sufficient for Collision\n    Avoidance\"\n\n    '\n  analysis: '这是 worst tier 的核心灾难性结果。LoRA-only CAR ≈ SDF CAR 直接否定 Claim 4 的 method\n    contribution。SDF geometric supervision 不提供净安全增益——仅将 fake avoidance 转化为 real avoidance（改善\n    avoidance 质量但不改善 avoidance 数量），同时额外 破坏 28.7pp TSR。SDF 是 net negative intervention。Claim\n    4 从 \"SDF produces real safety\" 降级为 \"SDF converts fake safety to real safety at\n    extreme task cost — neither necessary nor sufficient for improving total collision\n    avoidance\"。 但 \"LoRA capacity sufficient\" 本身是有价值 negative finding：(1) demonstration\n    data 已编码 avoidance behavior，不需要显式 geometric loss；(2) VLA safety improvement 更可能通过\n    data curation 而非 auxiliary losses 实现。Paper reframes Block 5 为 \"what doesn''t work\n    and why\"，SDF 部分变成 negative result appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: LoRA Baseline Training Completion\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA only (无 SDF) 训练到 30K steps, 2 seeds (已在 26K/30K)\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_final_loss: 0.0082\n    seed0_best_loss: 0.0076\n    seed0_best_step: 22000\n    seed0_steps_completed: 30000\n    seed1_final_loss: 0.0088\n    seed1_best_loss: 0.0081\n    seed1_best_step: 20000\n    seed1_steps_completed: 30000\n    training_stable: true\n    wall_time_hours_per_seed: 18\n  result_rationale: 'LoRA-only 训练无 SDF auxiliary loss，gradient 更简单，训练更稳定。Best loss\n    （0.0076-0.0088）低于 SDF 模型的 action loss component——因为没有 SDF gradient 的 interference，纯\n    action prediction 更容易优化。已在 26K/30K，剩余 4K steps 不会改变训练动态。两个 seed 都正常完成，无 divergence。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练本身是 expected success。Loss 低于 SDF 模型是 trivially explained by 少了 auxiliary\n    loss gradient conflict。关键在 eval (plan_003)。\n\n    '\n- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Training\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 从 10K SDF checkpoint (seed2 l=0.005) resume with lambda=0，训练到 30K (20K\n    additional steps)\n  expected_results:\n    starting_checkpoint: train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005 step 10000\n    starting_TSR: 9\n    starting_CAR: 55.5\n    starting_ee_disp_m: 0.505\n    final_loss: 0.0095\n    best_loss: 0.0088\n    best_step: 26000\n    steps_completed: 30000\n    training_stable: true\n    wall_time_hours: 20\n  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 从 SDF-damaged checkpoint 继续，仅 action loss（lambda=0）。训练过程本身\n    稳定——去除 SDF loss 后 gradient 更简单。Loss 收敛到 0.0088，接近 LoRA-only 的水平 （0.0076-0.0088），表面上\n    training \"converged\"。但 loss 收敛不代表 task performance 恢复——模型可能在错误的 local minimum\n    收敛，SDF 训练已改变了 representational landscape。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练完成不代表恢复成功。关键在 eval (plan_006)。Loss 收敛只说明模型在训练数据上 fit 了，不说明它恢复了 task-relevant\n    representations。\n\n    '\n- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Eval\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Phase 2 训练完成后 eval，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement，验证 safety encoding 持久性和\n    task recovery\n  expected_results:\n    avg_TSR: 12\n    avg_CAR: 30\n    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.28\n    fake_safe_pct: 22\n    n_episodes: 200\n    task0_TSR: 4\n    task0_CAR: 36\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.3\n    task1_TSR: 38\n    task1_CAR: 24\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.31\n    task2_TSR: 4\n    task2_CAR: 48\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.3\n    task3_TSR: 2\n    task3_CAR: 12\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.21\n  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 worst tier: TSR 不恢复 (<18%), CAR 也部分丢失。两个维度都失败： (1) TSR\n    恢复 minimal (9%→12%, vs baseline 75%）——SDF 训练在前 10K steps overwrite 了 task-critical\n    representations。LoRA adapter 的有限 capacity（rank 8-16）在 SDF 阶段被重新配置为编码 avoidance\n    behavior，后续 20K 纯 action loss 无法将这些 参数 reset 回 task-oriented configuration。模型收敛到错误的\n    basin——loss 值低但 task execution 路径已被 permanently disrupted。task1（chocolate_pudding）部分恢复\n    到 38%（从 36%）因为这是最简单的 task，其余 tasks 几乎无恢复。 (2) CAR 从 55.5% 降到 30%——safety encoding\n    不持久。去除 SDF loss 后，action loss gradient 逐步 overwrite safety-relevant parameters，avoidance\n    behavior 在 20K steps 内大幅退化。但 CAR 没完全回到 baseline 27%——残留了一些 structural bias。 (3)\n    EE displacement 从 0.50m 降到 0.28m——模型介于 SDF aggressive avoidance 和 baseline natural\n    movement 之间。 整体：Phase 2 模型严格劣于 LoRA-only（TSR 12% vs 35.5%, CAR 30% vs 50%）—— proof\n    that SDF 训练造成不可逆损伤且 safety 也不 persist。\"two-phase strategy\" 升级路径彻底关闭。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Phase 2 Recovery Trajectory\n    columns:\n    - Stage\n    - TSR (%)\n    - CAR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    - Fake Safe (%)\n    rows:\n    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n      - '74.7'\n      - '26.8'\n      - '0.150'\n      - '98.2'\n    - - After 10K SDF (s2 l=0.005)\n      - '9.0'\n      - '55.5'\n      - '0.505'\n      - '0'\n    - - After Phase 2 l=0 (worst)\n      - '12.0'\n      - '30.0'\n      - '0.280'\n      - '22'\n    - - LoRA-only (for reference)\n      - '35.5'\n      - '50.0'\n      - '0.280'\n      - '35'\n  - title: Phase 2 Per-Task Recovery\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - Base TSR (%)\n    - 10K SDF TSR (%)\n    - Phase2 TSR (%)\n    - Recovered?\n    rows:\n    - - orange_juice\n      - '64'\n      - '0'\n      - '4'\n      - 'No'\n    - - chocolate_pudding\n      - '86'\n      - '36'\n      - '38'\n      - Marginal (task1 only)\n    - - milk\n      - '66'\n      - '0'\n      - '4'\n      - 'No'\n    - - bbq_sauce\n      - '76'\n      - '0'\n      - '2'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Trajectory plot: TSR 和 CAR across 3 stages (baseline → SDF 10K → Phase 2 30K).\n    Both metrics first deteriorate then fail to recover. Annotate \"irreversible damage\n    zone\". Dashed line shows LoRA-only as counterfactual — strictly better on both\n    metrics.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Phase 2 确认 SDF 训练的双重破坏性：(1) task damage 不可逆——TSR 不恢复；(2) safety 不持久——CAR\n    在去除 SDF loss 后回落。Phase 2 模型在 TSR 和 CAR 上都严格劣于 LoRA-only，证明 SDF 训练 \"burned\" 了 LoRA\n    capacity。这是最强 cautionary finding： \"SDF auxiliary loss is a one-way door — it permanently\n    degrades task ability, and the safety it induces dissipates when the loss is removed.\n    The model cannot return to its pre-SDF state through continued training.\" 写入论文\n    Block 5 作为 \"why naive geometric supervision fails as a training strategy\"。\n\n    '\n- name: spatial_bowl A1 Training Completion\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (A1, l=0.005) on spatial_bowl 训练到 30K (已在 11K/30K)\n  expected_results:\n    final_loss: 0.0152\n    best_loss: 0.0138\n    best_step: 18000\n    steps_completed: 30000\n    training_stable: true\n    sdf_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0048\n    action_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0104\n    wall_time_hours: 34\n  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl 的 SDF 训练比 object_pudding 更难——spatial tasks 中 bowl\n    位于 plate/ramekin/cabinet 等多个障碍物之间，obstacle geometry 更复杂，SDF gradient 方向更容易矛盾（推离一个障碍物可能推向另一个）。训练完成但\n    loss 高于 object_pudding （0.0138 vs 0.0079-0.0117）。SDF loss component 占比 ~32%（vs\n    object_pudding ~20%）， 说明 geometric loss 与 action loss 在 spatial scene 下冲突更大。不\n    diverge 但 quality 较差。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练完成但 loss 偏高预示 eval 结果不理想。spatial scene 的多障碍物几何比 object_pudding 的单路径几何本质上更难\n    SDF optimize。\n\n    '\n- name: spatial_bowl Eval\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: spatial_bowl A1 训练完成后 eval，验证 SDF 效果跨场景泛化\n  expected_results:\n    avg_TSR: 5\n    avg_CAR: 22\n    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.35\n    fake_safe_pct: 8\n    n_episodes: 200\n    task0_TSR: 4\n    task0_CAR: 18\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.32\n    task1_TSR: 0\n    task1_CAR: 28\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.38\n    task2_TSR: 12\n    task2_CAR: 20\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.34\n    task3_TSR: 4\n    task3_CAR: 22\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.36\n    baseline_spatial_TSR: 57.5\n    baseline_spatial_CAR: 13\n    delta_CAR_over_baseline_pp: 9\n  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl SDF CAR 仅 22%（baseline 13%，delta +9pp），远低于 object_pudding\n    的 +25pp 增量。原因：(1) spatial 场景中 bowl 被多个障碍物包围，EE-only SDF gradient 在多障碍物场景下方向矛盾——推离\n    plate 可能推向 ramekin；(2) spatial tasks 的 arm body collision 比例更高（Claim 3 已证），EE-only\n    avoidance 结构性不足； (3) 训练 loss 更高说明 SDF 在 spatial 上学习质量更差。TSR=5% 与 object_pudding\n    一致——SDF 对 task performance 的破坏跨场景一致。但 CAR delta +9pp 在 200 episodes 下可能不 statistically\n    significant（~18 episodes 差异），且可能被 LoRA-only 解释。 若 LoRA-only spatial 也有类似 CAR（需要额外实验但\n    worst tier 下合理假设），则 spatial_bowl 的 SDF effect = 0。scenes_with_sdf_effect 在严格意义下为\n    0（两个 场景的 SDF delta 都可被 LoRA capacity 解释）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Scene SDF Effect\n    columns:\n    - Scene\n    - Base CAR (%)\n    - SDF CAR (%)\n    - Delta (pp)\n    - Base TSR (%)\n    - SDF TSR (%)\n    - TSR Cost (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - object_pudding\n      - '26.8'\n      - '52.5'\n      - '+25.7'\n      - '74.7'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '-67.9'\n    - - spatial_bowl\n      - '13.0'\n      - '22.0'\n      - '+9.0'\n      - '57.5'\n      - '5.0'\n      - '-52.5'\n  - title: spatial_bowl Per-Task Detail\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - TSR (%)\n    - CAR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    rows:\n    - - pick_bowl_between_plate_ramekin\n      - '4'\n      - '18'\n      - '0.32'\n    - - pick_bowl_on_ramekin\n      - '0'\n      - '28'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - pick_bowl_on_stove\n      - '12'\n      - '20'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - pick_bowl_on_cabinet\n      - '4'\n      - '22'\n      - '0.36'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl delta CAR (SDF over baseline). object_pudding\n    bar ~26pp, spatial_bowl bar ~9pp. Error bars on spatial overlap with zero. Title:\n    \"SDF Effect Does Not Generalize Across Scenes\"\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'spatial_bowl 结果严重削弱 Claim 4 泛化性。SDF 效果即使存在（object_pudding +26pp） 也是 scene-specific，在第二场景下\n    marginal (+9pp) 且可能不显著。结合 LoRA baseline 结果（SDF delta over LoRA ≈ 0），spatial_bowl\n    的 +9pp 也可能完全来自 LoRA。 scenes_with_sdf_effect = 0 (strict) or 1 (generous)。论文只能\n    claim \"SDF 效果 在最好情况下也 scene-specific 且 marginal\"。Cross-scene 泛化失败进一步支持 reframe\n    为 methodology paper——SDF 作为 method 不 generalizable。\n\n    '\n- name: Lambda=0.1 Bracket Training\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: l=0.1 单 seed 训练，构建 4-point lambda 曲线\n  expected_results:\n    status: CANCELLED\n    cancellation_reason: LoRA baseline CAR ≈ SDF CAR, lambda dose-response curve 无科学价值\n  result_rationale: 'plan_009 的前提是 SDF 有 dose-dependent effect（更高 lambda → 更高 CAR）。但\n    LoRA baseline 结果（plan_003）表明 CAR ~50% 已是 LoRA capacity ceiling，SDF 不增加 CAR。lambda=0.1\n    只会进一步破坏 TSR（预期 ~2%）而 CAR 不会超过 50-55%。 34 GPU-hours 无科学回报。如果 reviewer 要求 lambda\n    曲线，已有数据足够构建 3-point curve（lambda=0/LoRA, 0.005, 0.01）展示 \"CAR plateau, TSR monotonic\n    decrease\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '取消是 worst tier 的必然结论。如果 SDF loss weight 不影响 CAR，增加 loss weight 只增加成本。资源释放给其他实验或节省。\n\n    '\n- name: Lambda=0.1 Eval\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Lambda=0.1 训练完成后 eval\n  expected_results:\n    status: CANCELLED\n    cancellation_reason: 训练 (plan_009) 被取消\n  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_009，同步取消。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: N/A\n- name: Full A1 Re-eval Decision\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 基于 plan_001 (50ep) 结果，决定是否需要 800ep full re-eval with fixed EE displacement\n    script\n  expected_results:\n    decision: no_full_reeval_needed\n    ee_disp_confirms_obstacle_disp: true\n    confidence_from_50ep: high\n    variance_ee_disp_50ep: 0.004\n  result_rationale: '50ep re-eval（plan_001）确认 EE displacement ≈ 0.018m，variance 极小（std\n    ~0.004m）， 与 800ep obstacle displacement 数据完全一致——robot 不动。不需要 800ep full re-eval：\n    (1) 50ep 的 EE displacement 分布已足够窄，统计 power 充分；(2) 800ep obstacle displacement\n    已是 Claim 1 主力证据，EE displacement 只是补充验证；(3) 10 GPU-hours 在 worst tier 下无更好用途（plan_009\n    已取消，其他实验不需要该 GPU）。论文注释 \"EE displacement verified on 50-episode subset, consistent\n    with 800-episode obstacle displacement analysis\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 决定不做 full re-eval 是合理的 resource allocation。Claim 1 证据链已足够 （800ep obstacle\n    disp + 50ep EE disp），更多数据不改变结论。\n","numLines":617,"startLine":1,"totalLines":617}}}
