{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PAcJ6XdTkiWq3b43ZsWYf4","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-25\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| train_pi05_phase2_lambda0_s2 | Phase 2 λ=0 ablation (seed2): resume from seed2 l005 best (10K step) checkpoint with SDF loss disabled (λ=0). Tests whether early SDF-encoded collision awareness persists in LoRA weights when SDF loss is removed, while task performance (TSR) recovers. 10K additional steps with LoRA unfrozen. | — | — | — |\\\\n| train_pi05_a1_spatial_bowl_s0_l005 | Pi0.5+A1 SDF auxiliary loss on spatial_bowl scene (λ=0.005, seed 0). Tests cross-scene generalization of collision avoidance training. spatial_bowl has bilateral obstacles requiring bidirectional avoidance, distinct from object_pudding's single-side constraints. | — | — | — |\\\\n| train_pi05_lora_baseline_s1 | Pi0.5 LoRA baseline (no SDF) 30K on object_pudding seed 1: second seed for LoRA-only attribution baseline. Same setup as s0. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- eval_pi05_a1_best_s0_l005: Pi0.5+A1 best checkpoint eval (seed0, λ=0.005) using /best/ checkpoint. Completes 3-seed best-checkpoint coverage (s1 best=step16K, s2 best=step10K already done). s0 best=step26000. Tests whether best-loss checkpoint CAR/TSR matches s1/s2 pattern.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l01_disp** (success): Pi0.5+A1 30K displacement eval (seed0, λ=0.01): 用修复后的eval脚本重跑seed0 l01 30K checkpoint，获取含max_ee_displacement的完整eval结果。与10K best对比验证30K是否存在action collapse。 ← 基于 train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp** (success): Displacement fix验证: 重跑s1_l005_30k eval，验证修复后的eval_safelibero.py正确输出max_ee_displacement字段，safe episodes中应有合理分布（不再恒<0.001） ← 基于 eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_v3\\\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k** (success): Pi0.5+A1 best checkpoint eval (seed2, λ=0.005, step 10K): evaluates the sweet-spot checkpoint before action collapse. At 10K the model showed real collision avoidance (~0.4% filtered CAR). Compares with 30K (100% frozen) to demonstrate the collapse phenomenon quantitatively. ← 基于 train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 30 / 负向 16 / 失败 8 / 共 67\\\\navg_CAR: 52.5 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\navg_TSR: 6.5 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-35807: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\nwestd-45947: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- baseline_object_pudding_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_no_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_a3_spatial_force_refine_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_a3_spatial_m024fix_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- oracle_true_gt_object_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- train_pi05_a1_obj_l005: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- train_pi05_a1_obj_l01: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- train_pi05_phase2_lambda0_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3219, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015zhreRCQYFUhgnkByEUWzp","session_id":"82fe1c25-39c0-4259-b5cc-ba16f1a4fb53","uuid":"2b16798c-0052-4d50-8be9-3e0bf2