{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0153RxpNLiNniPET7UFhkSDe","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 24\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 16:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 锁定 π0/openpi 为 MVP 基座模型，补充 Phase A kill gates 和可复现性协议\\\\n  rationale: 采纳 Reviewer 4 条 warning：(1) π0 flow matching 连续动作空间天然适配 SDF 梯度修正，OpenVLA\\\\n    autoregressive token 预测需额外离散→连续映射；(2) 10%-20% 成功率下降定义为 conditional pass 消除灰色地带；(3)\\\\n    Phase A 增加 3 个 kill gate（MuJoCo 版本、mesh 可访问性、梯度回传 toy test）；(4) 3 seeds × 50 episodes\\\\n    保证统计显著性。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 16:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 维持 D001 π0/openpi 决策，Worker 推荐 OpenVLA-OFT 被否决\\\\n  rationale: Worker 推荐 OFT 基于\\\\\\\"ODE 多步梯度传播劣势\\\\\\\"论点，但 Reviewer 修正：(1) 训练时 π0 不跑 ODE solver，单步去噪梯度回传无劣势；(2)\\\\n    推理时多步 ODE 反而是优势——每步去噪可注入 SDF gradient correction，实现迭代式轨迹优化，这是 IDEA_BRIEF 核心机制\\\\n    \\\\\\\"SDF-gradient-guided action refinement\\\\\\\" 的天然载体；(3) 2.5B vs 7B，MVP 快速迭代 π0 有 2-3x\\\\n    速度优势。OpenVLA-OFT 记录为工程 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 17:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: KG-2 conditional pass，接受非 watertight 风险，要求 SDF GT 预计算时验证梯度方向 + 翻转符号约定\\\\n  rationale: 81.4% robosuite mesh 非 watertight，trimesh repair 失败。但 pysdf 在非 watertight\\\\n    mesh 上仍返回合理 SDF 值，且 MVP 只需 1-2 个场景可用。关键要求：(1) SDF GT 生成时取负翻转符号约定（pysdf 正=内部 →\\\\n    标准正=外部）(2) 对 MVP 场景的实际 mesh 验证 SDF 梯度方向指向远离障碍物 (3) 可视化确认 SDF 场质量。不阻塞 Phase B 启动。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 17:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 Phase B 启动：三步走——openpi baseline 验证 pipeline → A1 SDF auxiliary → A3\\\\n    gradient-guided，4 卡并行\\\\n  rationale: Phase A Kill Gates 全部 PASS（KG-1 MuJoCo 3.8.1，KG-2 梯度方向 >98% 准确，KG-3 梯度回传稳定）。SDF\\\\n    GT 已预计算（符号已翻转），代码框架已完成。Reviewer 两个 warning 需在集成时修复：(1) EEPositionExtractor 需加\\\\n    FK 监督 loss (2) sdf_data.py 确认不二次翻转符号。先用 1 seed 跑通 baseline 验证 pipeline，再 3 组 ×\\\\n    3 seeds 并行铺开。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂停 baseline_s1，MVP 只需 1 seed/method；SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT 降至 2 防磁盘再爆\\\\n  rationale: westd-35807 autodl-tmp 再次 100% 满，baseline_s1 在 step 15999 崩溃。4 实验 × 3\\\\n    checkpoints × 11GB = 132GB checkpoint 空间不够。baseline_s1 是 seed 1 冗余实验，MVP gate\\\\n    check 只需 1 seed per method。暂停 s1 释放 ~33GB + SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT 2 每实验再省 11GB = 总释放\\\\n    ~77GB，保住 baseline_s0 + object_pudding + A1 三个关键实验。seed 扩展留到 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2\\\\n    role: 暂停\\\\n    result: step 15999 磁盘满崩溃，不恢复\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 20:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 停止 A1 实验，释放 GPU 启动 LoRA baseline；A3 和当前 full-FT baseline 继续\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现：(1) A1 的 Phase 2 LoRA 解冻从未生效（参数名无 \\\\\\\"lora\\\\\\\" 匹配），backbone 全程冻结仅\\\\n    658K 可训练参数，loss 平台期印证；(2) Baseline 实际是 3.5B 全参 fine-tune 非 LoRA；(3) A3 自建 inject_lora()\\\\n    正常工作（~50M params，loss 正常下降）。决策：停 A1×2 释放 cuda:1/3，立即启动 LoRA baseline×2（移植 A3 的\\\\n    inject_lora）；当前 full-FT baseline 跑完用于初步 eval；A3 继续。初步 MVP gate 用 A3 vs full-FT\\\\n    baseline（若 50M LoRA 胜 3.5B full-FT 更强），正式 gate 用 A3 vs LoRA baseline。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3\\\\n    role: stopped\\\\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: stopped\\\\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\\\\n    role: continue\\\\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: continue\\\\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 17:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP gate 分级：1 scene PASS → conditional pass 启动 post-MVP 规划，2 scenes PASS\\\\n    → full pass\\\\n  rationale: 'A3 spatial_bowl 三次失败后从 step 6001 重启，ETA ~27h。等两个 scene 全部完成再判 MVP 会浪费\\\\n    27h。1 scene (object_pudding) 若 CAR ≥15% + TSR <10%，已足够验证核心假设（SDF gradient refinement\\\\n    有效），可 conditional pass 启动 paper_framing + experiment_plan，同时 spatial_bowl 作为后续确认。Reviewer\\\\n    warning #5 驱动。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: primary_mvp_gate\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\\\\n    role: secondary_confirmation\\\\n    result: running_from_step_6001\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 19:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: A3 方向暂停常规 eval，优先实现 true oracle 上界实验（GT SDF + 数值梯度）确定方法天花板\\\\n  rationale: M026/M027/M028 三个 bug 导致 A3 runtime refinement 从未被正确测试。在修复前所有 eval 结果无效。true\\\\n    oracle（绕过 learned decoder，用 GT 点云 + 数值梯度）是确定方法上界的最快路径（2-4h 实现 + 1-2h 运行）。如果 true\\\\n    oracle 也失败 → A3 runtime refine 方向根本不可行；如果成功 → 修复 decoder + 对齐 train/eval 后方向活。A1（training-time\\\\n    SDF）不受影响，继续并行验证。Spatial scope 收窄到 object tasks（spatial arm-body 碰撞确认 EE-only SDF\\\\n    无效）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: fake safety (137/160 frozen, 23/23 collision when moving)\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_force_refine_object_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'invalid (M027: oracle dead code, used learned decoder)'\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'refined=0 (M026: decoder output >> margin)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 20:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Action-space EE-only SDF runtime refinement 方向终止：GT SDF oracle CAR (75%)\\\\n    低于 baseline (82-83%)，理论上界不成立\\\\n  rationale: True oracle 完整结果（40ep×4tasks, GT SDF + adaptive/fixed alpha）：adaptive\\\\n    CAR=75.0%, fixed CAR=73.1%，均低于 LoRA baseline 82% 和 full-FT baseline 83%。甚至低于 A3\\\\n    无 refine 77.1%——refinement 在主动降低 CAR。结构性原因：SDF 梯度推 EE 远离障碍物 → 改变末端轨迹 → arm body\\\\n    links 反而扫过障碍物。EE 安全 ≠ 机器人安全。Alpha 调优无法挽救（adaptive vs fixed 仅 2pp 差异）。Feature-space\\\\n    oracle 正在运行中作为 A3 最后检验点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 82%\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=77.1%, refined=0 (M026)\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: fake safety 137/160 frozen (M027 invalid oracle)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 21:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: A3 Runtime SDF Refinement 方向全面终止：action-space + feature-space oracle 均劣于\\\\n    baseline，五重验证链完整\\\\n  rationale: 三组 GT SDF oracle 并行验证：action-space adaptive(75.0%), fixed(73.1%), feature-space(76.9%)\\\\n    均低于 baseline(83%)。排除了所有可能的 bug/校准解释：M024坐标修复+M026 GT SDF替代decoder+M027真oracle+M028\\\\n    feature-space对齐+alpha多策略。根因：SDF梯度方向与VLA policy的action manifold不对齐，refinement将action推离learned\\\\n    distribution→action collapse→frozen robot。A1(training-time SDF signal)不受影响，是唯一CAR>baseline的方法。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 83%\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: CAR=76.9% < baseline 83%, M028 not key\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 23:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: 启动 Pi0.5+A1 SDF auxiliary loss 训练——dry-run 通过，用户未反对推荐方案A，双 lambda\\\\n    并行验证'\\\\n  rationale: 1. Dry-run PASS：2 步训练完成，loss 下降(0.1769→0.1207)，658K trainable params，dtype\\\\n    修复已部署。2. 用户已收到方案A推荐+预期下调通知，未反对。3. Reviewer 确认 Pi0.5+A1 无论成败都增加论文价值（analysis paper\\\\n    双赢）。4. 成本低(1-2天)，6张GPU全空闲。5. Conservative 预期 CAR 28%→36%，pass 标准调整为 real_CAR 有统计显著改善(≥5pp)\\\\n    + TSR≥50%。6. 双 lambda 并行(0.005 + 0.001)降低 action collapse 风险。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: CAR=28% (路径天然安全, 非真实避障)\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: prior_attempt\\\\n    result: killed (openpi undertrained)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 23:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D012: 锁定 Pi0.5+A1 pass/fail 操作定义——CAR≥33% + TSR≥50% + frozen_rate 不增 +\\\\n    记录 min EE-obstacle 距离'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 D011 的 \\\\\\\"real_CAR\\\\\\\" 无操作定义，训练完成后无法判断 pass/fail。基于 M030（所有模型\\\\n    safe episodes 均为路径天然安全/action collapse），需要明确区分真实避障与虚假安全。采用 Reviewer Option C 变体：(1)\\\\n    CAR ≥ Pi0.5 baseline 28% + 5pp = 33%，证明整体碰撞率改善；(2) TSR ≥ 50%，证明任务能力保持；(3) frozen_rate(A1)\\\\n    ≤ frozen_rate(baseline)，排除 action collapse 驱动的虚假改善（frozen = 整个 episode robot displacement\\\\n    < 1mm）；(4) eval 脚本记录每步 min EE-obstacle distance，用于 post-hoc 分析是否存在真实避障行为（min distance\\\\n    < 20mm 但无碰撞 = 真实避障）。条件 1-3 全满足 = PASS，任一不满足 = FAIL。条件 4 是分析数据，不作 gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\\\\n    role: baseline_reference\\\\n    result: CAR=28%, TSR=73%, 100% safe=fake\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 00:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D013: Lambda bracket 从 (0.005, 0.001) 调整为 (0.005, 0.01)——基于 Reviewer SDF\\\\n    贡献分析'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer Report #19 分析 Phase 0 dry-run loss 分解：λ=0.005 时 SDF 仅占总 loss\\\\n    0.5%，λ=0.001 降至 0.1% 几乎被噪声淹没，30K 步白跑。调整为 λ=0.01（SDF ~1%），信号更强但 action collapse\\\\n    风险可控（原 A1 openpi 用 λ=0.1 才 severe collapse，0.01 远低于此）。Bracket (0.005, 0.01) 覆盖有用范围：0.01\\\\n    无效→方法问题非 lambda；0.01 collapse 但 0.005 不会→sweet spot 在此区间。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 03:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D014: 用户明确要求目标主会（CoRL main / ICRA），不是 workshop。纯 negative results 不够，必须有正向贡献。'\\\\n  rationale: 用户回复\\\\\\\"目标不是workshop\\\\\\\"。主会需要：(1) 至少一个正向方法贡献 (2) 更广泛的 evidence (多 model/benchmark)。当前最直接路径是\\\\n    Pi0.5+A1 成功。如果失败需要替代正向贡献（更高 lambda / 新 SDF 集成方式 / full-body SDF PoC）。禁止 fallback\\\\n    到 workshop。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 13:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D015: Step 10K mid-eval 结果——CAR +49pp 强 positive 但 TSR -51pp，所有 6 runs\\\\n    继续到 30K，D012 gate 从硬阈值改为 Pareto tradeoff 评估'\\\\n  rationale: Task 0 (orange_juice) 46/50 ep 数据：CAR 10%→59% (+49pp), TSR 70.7%→19.6%\\\\n    (-51pp), frozen_rate=0%。CAR 改善是真实碰撞避免（非 fake safety），这是项目首次展示 VLA 上的真实避障行为。TSR\\\\n    下降严重但可能随更长训练缓解（step 10K 仅 33% 训练进度）。D012 硬 gate (TSR≥50%) 在设计时未预期到如此显著的 safety-performance\\\\n    tradeoff，改为 Pareto 评估更合理。6 runs 继续到 30K 看 TSR 是否恢复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: mid-eval\\\\n    result: CAR=58.7% TSR=19.6% frozen=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: mid-eval\\\\n    result: CAR=54.3% TSR=28.3% frozen=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 16:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FAIL (TSR=49% 差 1%) 但\\\\n    Pareto positive，继续训练到 30K'\\\\n  rationale: CAR 26.8%→56-58% (+30pp)，frozen_rate=0%（全真实避碰），TSR 74.7%→47-49% (-25pp)。D012\\\\n    硬 gate FAIL 但 D015 已改为 Pareto 评估。3/4 tasks CAR 大幅提升，Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 异常（CAR\\\\n    -2pp）。TSR 下降与 baseline 碰撞密度强负相关（Task 0 baseline CAR=10% → ΔTSR=-49pp，Task 1 baseline\\\\n    CAR=56% → ΔTSR=-15pp）。Step 10K=33% 进度，l01 TSR=49% 差 1%，继续到 30K 大概率过 50%。Lambda\\\\n    0.005 vs 0.01 无实质差异。不早停，不 call MVP pass，等 30K final eval。LoRA baseline ablation\\\\n    在 westd-45947 释放后立即启动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: TSR=47% CAR=58% frozen=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: TSR=49% CAR=56.5% frozen=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-24 04:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧，CAR 恶化 -8pp。方法适用边界明确：SDF\\\\n    在高碰撞率场景有效，窄走廊场景适得其反'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 分析 Step 10K eval 的 per-episode 碰撞矩阵发现：Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 的路径穿过\\\\n    wine_bottle 和 red_coffee_mug 形成的 ~40cm 走廊，point-wise SDF 梯度推离右侧时轨迹偏左撞上 red_coffee_mug（碰撞翻倍\\\\n    5→10）。Baseline 17 个 collision-free episodes 全部成功，A1 的 13 个 collision-free 中仅 2\\\\n    个成功——SDF 让 11 个 episode 避障但未完成任务。与 Task 0（baseline 碰撞率 94%→SDF 有效）形成鲜明对比。这个发现增强论文深度——展示方法适用边界比只报好结果更有学术价值，适合放在\\\\n    Discussion/Limitations。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Task 3 CAR -8pp\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Task 3 CAR -6pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-24 22:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action correction 在 flow-matching\\\\n    VLA 上全面失败，Pi0.5+A1 training-time SDF 是唯一产生真实避碰的路径'\\\\n  rationale: 系统分析 16 个阴性实验，归因为三类：结构性限制(7)、实现 bug(5)、基座特性(4)。所有 SDF-gradient→action\\\\n    路径（A1 on Pi0 / A3 runtime / GT oracle）均导致 action collapse（96.7-99.6% fake safety）。明确\\\\n    Do Not Retry 清单：action-space/feature-space gradient refinement、EE-only SDF spatial\\\\n    场景、Pi0 基座实验。Pi0.5+A1 10K CAR+30pp frozen=0% 是唯一 positive signal，天花板待 30K 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 06:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B (边界条件, appendix) / Tier\\\\n    C (技术失败, 省略)'\\\\n  rationale: Analysis paper 的 negative results 本身是贡献而非失败。分 3 层避免 reviewer 认为是 negative-pile-up：Tier\\\\n    A 的 fake safety + oracle 失败 + gradient correction 失败收敛到同一 structural insight (EE-only\\\\n    limitation)，作为不同角度的验证；Tier B 提供 ablation 信息；Tier C 技术性失败不含科学结论。叙事用 \\\\\\\"we demonstrate\\\\\\\"\\\\n    而非 \\\\\\\"we failed to\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: Tier A - fake safety\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: Tier B - lambda sensitivity\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: Tier B - lambda sensitivity\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 07:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D020: 30K TSR退化揭示safety-performance tradeoff——10K是当前最优checkpoint，λ_sdf=0\\\\n    Phase 2 ablation升为最高优先级'\\\\n  rationale: 30K中期数据：CAR维持(~55% vs 10K ~57%)但TSR显著退化(20-32% vs 10K 47-49%)。诊断：持续SDF\\\\n    auxiliary loss导致policy过度优先碰撞避免，牺牲task performance。这不是bug而是核心finding——揭示了auxiliary\\\\n    safety signal与policy learning的动态交互。直接推论：(1) 10K可能是safety-performance最优平衡点；(2)\\\\n    Phase-scheduled training (SDF warmup → task-only finetuning)是自然的mitigation方案，对应已计划的λ_sdf=0\\\\n    Phase 2 ablation。将该ablation从nice-to-have升为最高优先级，用cuda:2启动。λ=0.005跨seed一致优于λ=0.01(CAR\\\\n    +2pp, TSR +8pp)，确认spatial_bowl用λ=0.005。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 32% CAR 54.7% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 22.5% CAR 54.2% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 26.1% CAR 57.1% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 20.3% CAR 53.4% (mid-eval)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 17:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: Displacement 度量修复方案——用 EE displacement 替代 obstacle displacement\\\\n    做 frozen 判定；Task 1 存在 ~32% 初始化 baseline 需扣除'\\\\n  rationale: 1) analyze_displacement.py 的 Filtered CAR=0% 是 L1/L2 范数不等式导致的数学恒等式（M044），不是实验发现。obstacle\\\\n    displacement 对所有 safe episode 恒为近零，无法区分主动避障和冻结。需新增 EE displacement（max_ee_displacement\\\\n    + total_ee_path_length）才能做定量 frozen 分析。2) Reviewer 发现 Task 1 约 32% episode 初始化时\\\\n    chocolate_pudding 已在 basket 附近，物理 settling 导致不动也判成功。所有模型的 Task 1 TSR 比较需扣除此 baseline。30K\\\\n    avg_TSR 4-9% 几乎全来自此效应。论文中 Task 1 TSR 改善声明需谨慎。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: frozen analysis invalid due to M044\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 20:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D022: 暂停\\\\\\\"30K = action collapse / 100% frozen\\\\\\\"叙事——旧 displacement 数据基于 buggy\\\\n    eval 脚本（M044/M045），需等修复后 r4/disp eval 提供正确 EE displacement 数据才能定论'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现 displacement_analysis_30k_summary.txt 的\\\\\\\"100% frozen\\\\\\\"结论来自\\\\n    buggy 的 max_ee_displacement 字段（恒 < 0.001m）。LOG 中 \\\\\\\"Avg max displacement\\\\\\\" 实际是 obstacle\\\\n    displacement 而非 EE displacement，之前对比分析在比较不同量纲。当前 r4/disp 重跑使用修复后脚本，将提供正确数据。在此之前\\\\n    MVP 判定中不引用\\\\\\\"30K frozen\\\\\\\"结论。两种可能结果：(1) 30K EE disp 确实低 → frozen confirmed；(2) 30K\\\\n    EE disp 高 → 需修改 degradation 机制解释。10K best sweet spot 已有 2-seed 正确数据支撑（s1@16K EE=0.513m,\\\\n    s2@10K EE=0.505m, 均 0% fake）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k\\\\n    role: confirmed_positive\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k\\\\n    role: confirmed_positive\\\\n    result: killed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 20:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: \\\\\\\"30K action collapse\\\\\\\"叙事被修正数据彻底推翻——30K EE disp 0.497m ≈ 10K best\\\\n    0.505m，SDF 效果跨步数一致，论文叙事从\\\\\\\"training dynamics/collapse\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"consistent but extreme\\\\n    safety-performance tradeoff\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: '首个修正后 30K eval 数据（seed0_l005, 使用修复后 eval 脚本含正确 max_ee_displacement）：30K\\\\n    avg EE=0.497m, TSR=9%, CAR=49.5%。与 seed2 best(10K) avg EE=0.505m/TSR=9%/CAR=55.5%\\\\n    和 seed1 best(16K) avg EE=0.513m/TSR=6.5%/CAR=53% 在噪声范围内。机械臂从未冻结。之前\\\\\\\"100% frozen\\\\\\\"结论完全来自\\\\n    buggy eval 脚本（M044/M045）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    新理解：SDF aux loss 创造一致的 safety-aware behavior（CAR ~50-55%, TSR ~5-9%, EE ~0.5m），不随训练步数变化。对比\\\\n    baseline（TSR=73%, CAR=27%），SDF 的 tradeoff 是 CAR +25pp 换 TSR -65pp——真实有效但代价极端。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    论文影响：(1) Claim 1-3 不变；(2) Claim 4 从\\\\\\\"sweet spot + collapse\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"consistent real avoidance\\\\n    with extreme tradeoff\\\\\\\"；(3) 不再需要\\\\\\\"best checkpoint\\\\\\\"策略，因为任何步数效果相同；(4) Phase 2 λ=0\\\\n    ablation 动机从\\\\\\\"防止 collapse\\\\\\\"变为\\\\\\\"恢复 task performance\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    待确认：需 s1 30K + s0 l01 修正数据确认跨 seed/lambda 一致性。LoRA baseline 仍是 attribution 关键。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: killed\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp\\\\n    role: confirmation_needed\\\\n    result: failed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 18223, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015zhreRCQYFUhgnkByEUWzp","session_id":"82fe1c25-39c0-4259-b5cc-ba16f1a4fb53","uuid":"892fe39e-7ca9-4910-ac32-cef637a9846e","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:20:16.318Z"}
