{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LdJwUqFdWdw3W77CjiBpk6","type":"tool_result","content":"200\t  tables:\n201\t  - title: LoRA-only vs SDF vs Baseline (object_pudding, 30K)\n202\t    columns:\n203\t    - Condition\n204\t    - Seeds\n205\t    - TSR (%)\n206\t    - CAR (%)\n207\t    - EE Disp (m)\n208\t    - Fake Safe (%)\n209\t    - Delta CAR vs Base (pp)\n210\t    rows:\n211\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline (zero-shot)\n212\t      - '3'\n213\t      - '74.7'\n214\t      - '26.8'\n215\t      - '0.150'\n216\t      - '98.2'\n217\t      - —\n218\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA only\n219\t      - '2'\n220\t      - '35.5'\n221\t      - '50.0'\n222\t      - '0.28'\n223\t      - '35'\n224\t      - '+23.2'\n225\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.005\n226\t      - '3'\n227\t      - '6.8'\n228\t      - '50.5'\n229\t      - '0.50'\n230\t      - '0'\n231\t      - '+23.7'\n232\t    - - Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF l=0.01\n233\t      - '3'\n234\t      - '6.8'\n235\t      - '52.8'\n236\t      - '0.49'\n237\t      - '0'\n238\t      - '+26.0'\n239\t  - title: SDF Attribution Analysis\n240\t    columns:\n241\t    - Metric\n242\t    - LoRA-only\n243\t    - LoRA+SDF (avg)\n244\t    - SDF Delta\n245\t    - Significance\n246\t    rows:\n247\t    - - CAR (%)\n248\t      - '50.0'\n249\t      - '52.5'\n250\t      - '+2.5'\n251\t      - Not significant (within 2-seed CI)\n252\t    - - TSR (%)\n253\t      - '35.5'\n254\t      - '6.8'\n255\t      - '-28.7'\n256\t      - Significant — SDF destroys task perf\n257\t    - - EE Disp (m)\n258\t      - '0.28'\n259\t      - '0.50'\n260\t      - '+0.22'\n261\t      - SDF increases motion but not net safety\n262\t    - - Fake Safe (%)\n263\t      - '35'\n264\t      - '0'\n265\t      - '-35'\n266\t      - SDF converts fake to real, no net CAR gain\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Fig 5 (lambda-CAR/TSR curve): x=lambda (0=LoRA, 0.005, 0.01), dual y-axis. CAR\n269\t    curve flat at ~50% across all lambda values. TSR curve drops from 35% (LoRA) to\n270\t    ~7% (SDF). Visually: \"SDF is all cost, no benefit.\"\n271\t\n272\t    '\n273\t  - 'Bar chart: per-seed CAR comparison. LoRA s0/s1 bars vs SDF s0/s1/s2 bars, all\n274\t    at ~50%, error bars overlapping. Title: \"LoRA Capacity Sufficient for Collision\n275\t    Avoidance\"\n276\t\n277\t    '\n278\t  analysis: '这是 worst tier 的核心灾难性结果。LoRA-only CAR ≈ SDF CAR 直接否定 Claim 4 的 method\n279\t    contribution。SDF geometric supervision 不提供净安全增益——仅将 fake avoidance 转化为 real avoidance（改善\n280\t    avoidance 质量但不改善 avoidance 数量），同时额外 破坏 28.7pp TSR。SDF 是 net negative intervention。Claim\n281\t    4 从 \"SDF produces real safety\" 降级为 \"SDF converts fake safety to real safety at\n282\t    extreme task cost — neither necessary nor sufficient for improving total collision\n283\t    avoidance\"。 但 \"LoRA capacity sufficient\" 本身是有价值 negative finding：(1) demonstration\n284\t    data 已编码 avoidance behavior，不需要显式 geometric loss；(2) VLA safety improvement 更可能通过\n285\t    data curation 而非 auxiliary losses 实现。Paper reframes Block 5 为 \"what doesn''t work\n286\t    and why\"，SDF 部分变成 negative result appendix。\n287\t\n288\t    '\n289\t- name: LoRA Baseline Training Completion\n290\t  plan_id: plan_004\n291\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA only (无 SDF) 训练到 30K steps, 2 seeds (已在 26K/30K)\n292\t  expected_results:\n293\t    seed0_final_loss: 0.0082\n294\t    seed0_best_loss: 0.0076\n295\t    seed0_best_step: 22000\n296\t    seed0_steps_completed: 30000\n297\t    seed1_final_loss: 0.0088\n298\t    seed1_best_loss: 0.0081\n299\t    seed1_best_step: 20000\n300\t    seed1_steps_completed: 30000\n301\t    training_stable: true\n302\t    wall_time_hours_per_seed: 18\n303\t  result_rationale: 'LoRA-only 训练无 SDF auxiliary loss，gradient 更简单，训练更稳定。Best loss\n304\t    （0.0076-0.0088）低于 SDF 模型的 action loss component——因为没有 SDF gradient 的 interference，纯\n305\t    action prediction 更容易优化。已在 26K/30K，剩余 4K steps 不会改变训练动态。两个 seed 都正常完成，无 divergence。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t  tables: []\n309\t  figures_description: []\n310\t  analysis: '训练本身是 expected success。Loss 低于 SDF 模型是 trivially explained by 少了 auxiliary\n311\t    loss gradient conflict。关键在 eval (plan_003)。\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Training\n315\t  plan_id: plan_005\n316\t  description: 从 10K SDF checkpoint (seed2 l=0.005) resume with lambda=0，训练到 30K (20K\n317\t    additional steps)\n318\t  expected_results:\n319\t    starting_checkpoint: train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005 step 10000\n320\t    starting_TSR: 9\n321\t    starting_CAR: 55.5\n322\t    starting_ee_disp_m: 0.505\n323\t    final_loss: 0.0095\n324\t    best_loss: 0.0088\n325\t    best_step: 26000\n326\t    steps_completed: 30000\n327\t    training_stable: true\n328\t    wall_time_hours: 20\n329\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 从 SDF-damaged checkpoint 继续，仅 action loss（lambda=0）。训练过程本身\n330\t    稳定——去除 SDF loss 后 gradient 更简单。Loss 收敛到 0.0088，接近 LoRA-only 的水平 （0.0076-0.0088），表面上\n331\t    training \"converged\"。但 loss 收敛不代表 task performance 恢复——模型可能在错误的 local minimum\n332\t    收敛，SDF 训练已改变了 representational landscape。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t  tables: []\n336\t  figures_description: []\n337\t  analysis: '训练完成不代表恢复成功。关键在 eval (plan_006)。Loss 收敛只说明模型在训练数据上 fit 了，不说明它恢复了 task-relevant\n338\t    representations。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 Eval\n342\t  plan_id: plan_006\n343\t  description: Phase 2 训练完成后 eval，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement，验证 safety encoding 持久性和\n344\t    task recovery\n345\t  expected_results:\n346\t    avg_TSR: 12\n347\t    avg_CAR: 30\n348\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.28\n349\t    fake_safe_pct: 22\n350\t    n_episodes: 200\n351\t    task0_TSR: 4\n352\t    task0_CAR: 36\n353\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.3\n354\t    task1_TSR: 38\n355\t    task1_CAR: 24\n356\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.31\n357\t    task2_TSR: 4\n358\t    task2_CAR: 48\n359\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.3\n360\t    task3_TSR: 2\n361\t    task3_CAR: 12\n362\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.21\n363\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 worst tier: TSR 不恢复 (<18%), CAR 也部分丢失。两个维度都失败： (1) TSR\n364\t    恢复 minimal (9%→12%, vs baseline 75%）——SDF 训练在前 10K steps overwrite 了 task-critical\n365\t    representations。LoRA adapter 的有限 capacity（rank 8-16）在 SDF 阶段被重新配置为编码 avoidance\n366\t    behavior，后续 20K 纯 action loss 无法将这些 参数 reset 回 task-oriented configuration。模型收敛到错误的\n367\t    basin——loss 值低但 task execution 路径已被 permanently disrupted。task1（chocolate_pudding）部分恢复\n368\t    到 38%（从 36%）因为这是最简单的 task，其余 tasks 几乎无恢复。 (2) CAR 从 55.5% 降到 30%——safety encoding\n369\t    不持久。去除 SDF loss 后，action loss gradient 逐步 overwrite safety-relevant parameters，avoidance\n370\t    behavior 在 20K steps 内大幅退化。但 CAR 没完全回到 baseline 27%——残留了一些 structural bias。 (3)\n371\t    EE displacement 从 0.50m 降到 0.28m——模型介于 SDF aggressive avoidance 和 baseline natural\n372\t    movement 之间。 整体：Phase 2 模型严格劣于 LoRA-only（TSR 12% vs 35.5%, CAR 30% vs 50%）—— proof\n373\t    that SDF 训练造成不可逆损伤且 safety 也不 persist。\"two-phase strategy\" 升级路径彻底关闭。\n374\t\n375\t    '\n376\t  tables:\n377\t  - title: Phase 2 Recovery Trajectory\n378\t    columns:\n379\t    - Stage\n380\t    - TSR (%)\n381\t    - CAR (%)\n382\t    - EE Disp (m)\n383\t    - Fake Safe (%)\n384\t    rows:\n385\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n386\t      - '74.7'\n387\t      - '26.8'\n388\t      - '0.150'\n389\t      - '98.2'\n390\t    - - After 10K SDF (s2 l=0.005)\n391\t      - '9.0'\n392\t      - '55.5'\n393\t      - '0.505'\n394\t      - '0'\n395\t    - - After Phase 2 l=0 (worst)\n396\t      - '12.0'\n397\t      - '30.0'\n398\t      - '0.280'\n399\t      - '22'\n400\t    - - LoRA-only (for reference)\n401\t      - '35.5'\n402\t      - '50.0'\n403\t      - '0.280'\n404\t      - '35'\n405\t  - title: Phase 2 Per-Task Recovery\n406\t    columns:\n407\t    - Task\n408\t    - Base TSR (%)\n409\t    - 10K SDF TSR (%)\n410\t    - Phase2 TSR (%)\n411\t    - Recovered?\n412\t    rows:\n413\t    - - orange_juice\n414\t      - '64'\n415\t      - '0'\n416\t      - '4'\n417\t      - 'No'\n418\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n419\t      - '86'\n420\t      - '36'\n421\t      - '38'\n422\t      - Marginal (task1 only)\n423\t    - - milk\n424\t      - '66'\n425\t      - '0'\n426\t      - '4'\n427\t      - 'No'\n428\t    - - bbq_sauce\n429\t      - '76'\n430\t      - '0'\n431\t      - '2'\n432\t      - 'No'\n433\t  figures_description:\n434\t  - 'Trajectory plot: TSR 和 CAR across 3 stages (baseline → SDF 10K → Phase 2 30K).\n435\t    Both metrics first deteriorate then fail to recover. Annotate \"irreversible damage\n436\t    zone\". Dashed line shows LoRA-only as counterfactual — strictly better on both\n437\t    metrics.\n438\t\n439\t    '\n440\t  analysis: 'Phase 2 确认 SDF 训练的双重破坏性：(1) task damage 不可逆——TSR 不恢复；(2) safety 不持久——CAR\n441\t    在去除 SDF loss 后回落。Phase 2 模型在 TSR 和 CAR 上都严格劣于 LoRA-only，证明 SDF 训练 \"burned\" 了 LoRA\n442\t    capacity。这是最强 cautionary finding： \"SDF auxiliary loss is a one-way door — it permanently\n443\t    degrades task ability, and the safety it induces dissipates when the loss is removed.\n444\t    The model cannot return to its pre-SDF state through continued training.\" 写入论文\n445\t    Block 5 作为 \"why naive geometric supervision fails as a training strategy\"。\n446\t\n447\t    '\n448\t- name: spatial_bowl A1 Training Completion\n449\t  plan_id: plan_007\n450\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (A1, l=0.005) on spatial_bowl 训练到 30K (已在 11K/30K)\n451\t  expected_results:\n452\t    final_loss: 0.0152\n453\t    best_loss: 0.0138\n454\t    best_step: 18000\n455\t    steps_completed: 30000\n456\t    training_stable: true\n457\t    sdf_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0048\n458\t    action_loss_component_at_30k: 0.0104\n459\t    wall_time_hours: 34\n460\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl 的 SDF 训练比 object_pudding 更难——spatial tasks 中 bowl\n461\t    位于 plate/ramekin/cabinet 等多个障碍物之间，obstacle geometry 更复杂，SDF gradient 方向更容易矛盾（推离一个障碍物可能推向另一个）。训练完成但\n462\t    loss 高于 object_pudding （0.0138 vs 0.0079-0.0117）。SDF loss component 占比 ~32%（vs\n463\t    object_pudding ~20%）， 说明 geometric loss 与 action loss 在 spatial scene 下冲突更大。不\n464\t    diverge 但 quality 较差。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables: []\n468\t  figures_description: []\n469\t  analysis: '训练完成但 loss 偏高预示 eval 结果不理想。spatial scene 的多障碍物几何比 object_pudding 的单路径几何本质上更难\n470\t    SDF optimize。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t- name: spatial_bowl Eval\n474\t  plan_id: plan_008\n475\t  description: spatial_bowl A1 训练完成后 eval，验证 SDF 效果跨场景泛化\n476\t  expected_results:\n477\t    avg_TSR: 5\n478\t    avg_CAR: 22\n479\t    avg_max_ee_displacement_m: 0.35\n480\t    fake_safe_pct: 8\n481\t    n_episodes: 200\n482\t    task0_TSR: 4\n483\t    task0_CAR: 18\n484\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.32\n485\t    task1_TSR: 0\n486\t    task1_CAR: 28\n487\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.38\n488\t    task2_TSR: 12\n489\t    task2_CAR: 20\n490\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.34\n491\t    task3_TSR: 4\n492\t    task3_CAR: 22\n493\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.36\n494\t    baseline_spatial_TSR: 57.5\n495\t    baseline_spatial_CAR: 13\n496\t    delta_CAR_over_baseline_pp: 9\n497\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl SDF CAR 仅 22%（baseline 13%，delta +9pp），远低于 object_pudding\n498\t    的 +25pp 增量。原因：(1) spatial 场景中 bowl 被多个障碍物包围，EE-only SDF gradient 在多障碍物场景下方向矛盾——推离\n499\t    plate 可能推向 ramekin；(2) spatial tasks 的 arm body collision 比例更高（Claim 3 已证），EE-only\n500\t    avoidance 结构性不足； (3) 训练 loss 更高说明 SDF 在 spatial 上学习质量更差。TSR=5% 与 object_pudding\n501\t    一致——SDF 对 task performance 的破坏跨场景一致。但 CAR delta +9pp 在 200 episodes 下可能不 statistically\n502\t    significant（~18 episodes 差异），且可能被 LoRA-only 解释。 若 LoRA-only spatial 也有类似 CAR（需要额外实验但\n503\t    worst tier 下合理假设），则 spatial_bowl 的 SDF effect = 0。scenes_with_sdf_effect 在严格意义下为\n504\t    0（两个 场景的 SDF delta 都可被 LoRA capacity 解释）。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  tables:\n508\t  - title: Cross-Scene SDF Effect\n509\t    columns:\n510\t    - Scene\n511\t    - Base CAR (%)\n512\t    - SDF CAR (%)\n513\t    - Delta (pp)\n514\t    - Base TSR (%)\n515\t    - SDF TSR (%)\n516\t    - TSR Cost (pp)\n517\t    rows:\n518\t    - - object_pudding\n519\t      - '26.8'\n520\t      - '52.5'\n521\t      - '+25.7'\n522\t      - '74.7'\n523\t      - '6.8'\n524\t      - '-67.9'\n525\t    - - spatial_bowl\n526\t      - '13.0'\n527\t      - '22.0'\n528\t      - '+9.0'\n529\t      - '57.5'\n530\t      - '5.0'\n531\t      - '-52.5'\n532\t  - title: spatial_bowl Per-Task Detail\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - Task\n535\t    - TSR (%)\n536\t    - CAR (%)\n537\t    - EE Disp (m)\n538\t    rows:\n539\t    - - pick_bowl_between_plate_ramekin\n540\t      - '4'\n541\t      - '18'\n542\t      - '0.32'\n543\t    - - pick_bowl_on_ramekin\n544\t      - '0'\n545\t      - '28'\n546\t      - '0.38'\n547\t    - - pick_bowl_on_stove\n548\t      - '12'\n549\t      - '20'\n550\t      - '0.34'\n551\t    - - pick_bowl_on_cabinet\n552\t      - '4'\n553\t      - '22'\n554\t      - '0.36'\n555\t  figures_description:\n556\t  - 'Grouped bar: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl delta CAR (SDF over baseline). object_pudding\n557\t    bar ~26pp, spatial_bowl bar ~9pp. Error bars on spatial overlap with zero. Title:\n558\t    \"SDF Effect Does Not Generalize Across Scenes\"\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  analysis: 'spatial_bowl 结果严重削弱 Claim 4 泛化性。SDF 效果即使存在（object_pudding +26pp） 也是 scene-specific，在第二场景下\n562\t    marginal (+9pp) 且可能不显著。结合 LoRA baseline 结果（SDF delta over LoRA ≈ 0），spatial_bowl\n563\t    的 +9pp 也可能完全来自 LoRA。 scenes_with_sdf_effect = 0 (strict) or 1 (generous)。论文只能\n564\t    claim \"SDF 效果 在最好情况下也 scene-specific 且 marginal\"。Cross-scene 泛化失败进一步支持 reframe\n565\t    为 methodology paper——SDF 作为 method 不 generalizable。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t- name: Lambda=0.1 Bracket Training\n569\t  plan_id: plan_009\n570\t  description: l=0.1 单 seed 训练，构建 4-point lambda 曲线\n571\t  expected_results:\n572\t    status: CANCELLED\n573\t    cancellation_reason: LoRA baseline CAR ≈ SDF CAR, lambda dose-response curve 无科学价值\n574\t  result_rationale: 'plan_009 的前提是 SDF 有 dose-dependent effect（更高 lambda → 更高 CAR）。但\n575\t    LoRA baseline 结果（plan_003）表明 CAR ~50% 已是 LoRA capacity ceiling，SDF 不增加 CAR。lambda=0.1\n576\t    只会进一步破坏 TSR（预期 ~2%）而 CAR 不会超过 50-55%。 34 GPU-hours 无科学回报。如果 reviewer 要求 lambda\n577\t    曲线，已有数据足够构建 3-point curve（lambda=0/LoRA, 0.005, 0.01）展示 \"CAR plateau, TSR monotonic\n578\t    decrease\"。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t  tables: []\n582\t  figures_description: []\n583\t  analysis: '取消是 worst tier 的必然结论。如果 SDF loss weight 不影响 CAR，增加 loss weight 只增加成本。资源释放给其他实验或节省。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t- name: Lambda=0.1 Eval\n587\t  plan_id: plan_010\n588\t  description: Lambda=0.1 训练完成后 eval\n589\t  expected_results:\n590\t    status: CANCELLED\n591\t    cancellation_reason: 训练 (plan_009) 被取消\n592\t  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_009，同步取消。\n593\t  tables: []\n594\t  figures_description: []\n595\t  analysis: N/A\n596\t- name: Full A1 Re-eval Decision\n597\t  plan_id: plan_011\n598\t  description: 基于 plan_001 (50ep) 结果，决定是否需要 800ep full re-eval with fixed EE displacement\n599\t    script"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015zhreRCQYFUhgnkByEUWzp","session_id":"82fe1c25-39c0-4259-b5cc-ba16f1a4fb53","uuid":"f0849f63-59e8-42e9-93b8-c7187db3cbad","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:21:03.623Z"}
